 elementor-element-6e4b3a7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6e4b3a7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cac10eb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cac10eb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31b59f2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"31b59f2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1c7125 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d1c7125\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Controlling Mosquitoes at their Larval Stage<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c94d445 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c94d445\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The most significant impact on mosquito populations occurs when they are immobile, concentrated, and accessible. So, we focus on habitat management, thereby controlling immature stages before they emerge as adults.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e004d0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8e004d0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-394e043 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"394e043\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec23c9e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ec23c9e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a5e1c0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7a5e1c0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d55a95 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d55a95\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72d2226 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"72d2226\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Controlling Adult Mosquitoes<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b35c3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b35c3f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Using the EPA-registered pesticide is a speedy approach to combat mosquito-borne disease outbreaks. So, we also focus on controlling adult mosquitoes and eliminating them from your house.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db52063 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"db52063\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-996d4d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"996d4d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"696\" height=\"461\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Controlling-Adult-Mosquitoes.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1512\" alt=\"Mosquito Pest Control\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Controlling-Adult-Mosquitoes.jpg.webp 696w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Controlling-Adult-Mosquitoes.jpg-300x199.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 696px) 100vw, 696px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3fe4b1e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3fe4b1e\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f8f859d\" data-id=\"f8f859d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-91dafbb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"91dafbb\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-a206dd9\" data-id=\"a206dd9\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73358e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"73358e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd8e94d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bd8e94d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Us for Mosquito Control Solutions?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a957b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a957b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Exterminating mosquitoes from your house requires a comprehensive approach. Thus, at 7 States Pest Control, our\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\" rel=\"noopener\">affordable pest control Melbourne<\/a>\u00a0consultants implement scientifically-proven methodologies to eliminate the pest from commercial and residential properties. Our effective pest control methods target the mosquito life cycle\u2019s larval stage. With our practices, we try to eradicate different species of mosquitoes, including Aedes.<\/